{
  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "nats-01",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：在 nats 快照中，MaxMsgs、MaxBytes、MaxAge 在 WorkQueuePolicy 与 InterestPolicy 下仍作为保留消息的上限。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 11,
          "end": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-02",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "错误：WorkQueuePolicy 不允许在同一 Stream 上定义匹配相同 subject 的重叠消费者；快照说明每个被 stream 捕获的 subject 一次只能有一个消费者。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-03",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：InterestPolicy 会保留消息，直到该 subject 的相关消费者全部收到显式确认后再删除。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-04",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：可用 MaxMsgSize 把单个消息接受上限设得低于快照中所述的 NATS 默认总体限制 1 MiB。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-05",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：DiscardOld 删除旧消息为新消息腾出空间，DiscardNew 拒绝新消息。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 15,
          "end": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-06",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "错误：发布去重依据 Nats-Msg-Id 头；快照明确说只参考消息 ID，不比较消息 body。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 18,
          "end": 18
        },
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 25,
          "end": 25
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-07",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：默认去重窗口为 2 分钟，创建 stream 时可用 --dupe-window 配置。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 36,
          "end": 36
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-08",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "错误：Request() 会在消息存储后收到服务回复，普通 publish 不会，因此两者不会总收到相同持久化响应。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 38,
          "end": 38
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-09",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：将 Stream 的 NoAck 设为 true 可关闭 Stream 端确认。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 38,
          "end": 38
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-10",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：在 nats 快照的 Acknowledgement Models 表格中，AckExplicit 被描述为 pull-based Consumer 唯一支持的确认选项。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 42,
          "end": 42
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-11",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：AckAll 模式下确认消息 100 也会确认消息 1 至 99。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 43,
          "end": 43
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-12",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：快照表格将 AckFlowControl 标注为 2.14 特性。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 45,
          "end": 45
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-13",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：AckAck 表示消息已被完全处理。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 175,
          "end": 175
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-14",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：AckNak 表示当前不处理该消息，处理可移动到下一条，NAK 的消息会被重试。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 176,
          "end": 176
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-15",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：在 AckWait 到期前发送 AckProgress 会指示工作仍在进行，并将等待期延长一个等长的 AckWait。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 177,
          "end": 177
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-16",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "错误：AckTerm 要求服务器停止重投，但不表示消息已成功处理或确认。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 179,
          "end": 179
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-17",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "错误：快照说明除 AckNext 外这些确认模式支持 double acknowledgement，AckNext 不在此列。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 181,
          "end": 181
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-18",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：快照以消息去重与 double ack 的组合说明 JetStream 的 exactly-once 发布与消费语义。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 184,
          "end": 184
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-19",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：DeliverPolicy 只决定首个消费起点；启动后按已看到/已确认状态继续，并非持续重置的过滤条件。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 188,
          "end": 196
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-20",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：Durable consumer 在断开连接后仍存在；ephemeral consumer 只要 delivery subject 有订阅就存在，无订阅者后经短暂宽限期自动移除。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats",
          "start": 248,
          "end": 249
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-21",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：nats-consumers 将 Core NATS 描述为至多一次投递，而 JetStream consumer 可提供至少一次投递保证。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats-consumers",
          "start": 4,
          "end": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-22",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：push consumer 向指定 subject 推送消息；pull consumer 由客户端按需请求消息批次。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats-consumers",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-23",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：该页推荐新项目优先使用 pull consumer，尤其是在考虑扩展性、详细流控或错误处理时。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats-consumers",
          "start": 14,
          "end": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-24",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "错误：Ordered consumer 的文档属性明确说明它总是 ephemeral，而不是 durable。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats-consumers",
          "start": 17,
          "end": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-25",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：Ordered consumer 不使用确认；若检测到 gap，会重建 consumer。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats-consumers",
          "start": 20,
          "end": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-26",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：Ordered consumer 是单线程分发，并且没有负载均衡。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats-consumers",
          "start": 22,
          "end": 23
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-27",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "错误：仅设置 Name 不设置 Durable 不会创建 durable consumer；快照说明这样创建的是服务器仍按 ephemeral 处理的命名 consumer。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats-consumers",
          "start": 26,
          "end": 26
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-28",
      "verdict": "refuted",
      "fact": "错误：设置 InactiveThreshold 不会让 consumer 变成 durable；它只控制不活跃 consumer 的自动清理。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats-consumers",
          "start": 26,
          "end": 26
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "nats-29",
      "verdict": "supported",
      "fact": "支持：ephemeral consumer 不持久化状态，也没有容错；其状态只保存在服务器内存中。",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "nats-consumers",
          "start": 27,
          "end": 27
        }
